PR review on vybestack/llxprt-code

Review comment:
_⚠️ Potential issue_ | _🟠 Major_ | _⚡ Quick win_

**Avoid clearing global auth-complete flags from stale attempts.**

Line 322 resets `__oauth_auth_complete` even when this attempt is already stale. That can clobber a newer successful attempt’s completion signal and leave relogin/auth-error state uncleared.

<details>
<summary>Suggested fix</summary>

```diff
-      const oauthState = global as unknown as {
-        __oauth_browser_auth_complete?: boolean;
-        __oauth_auth_complete?: boolean;
-      };
-      oauthState.__oauth_browser_auth_complete = false;
-      oauthState.__oauth_auth_complete = false;
       throw new Error('Auth attempt cancelled');
```
</details>

